    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεστ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill full of</i>, c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργῆς μ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					280
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be filled</i> or <i>full of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					713
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				420
			</span></i>; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρρησίας μεστοῦσθαι καὶ ἐλευθερίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					649b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβρεώς τε καὶ ἀδικίας</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				713c
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; and in medic. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγεῖα μεμεστωμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.394
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.932
			</span></i>.</div>
